        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://silvercreektwp.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Commercial fishing once thrived along Silver Creek’s waterways, but today the area focuses on tourism and recreation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.silvercreekmnlakeco.gov/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The township emphasizes transparent governance, community services, and natural preservation since its founding.",
